1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,705
She moves to Bhaktapur.

2
00:00:01,705 --> 00:00:03,697
The office updates its copy.

3
00:00:03,697 --> 00:00:06,093
Nobody tells the exam section.

4
00:00:06,093 --> 00:00:11,575
Now the school has two different answers to one question, and no way to know which is right.

5
00:00:11,575 --> 00:00:15,625
That is what goes wrong when the same data is stored in many places.

